146 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (To critique subjectivity, then, is not to escape its grasp, but to unmask its language, the silent grammar through which power speaks. The question that remains is not how to reclaim the self, but whether thought itself can be disentangled from the patriarchal logic of recognition. What form of being might exist beyond the need to be assured?)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
